es that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami","kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/fileExporter(isPresented:document:contentType:defaultFilename:onCompletion:)-8h2ag":{"title":"fileExporter(isPresented:document:contentType:defaultFilename:onCompletion:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/fileExporter(isPresented:document:contentType:defaultFilename:onCompletion:)-8h2ag","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/fileexporter(ispresented:document:contenttype:defaultfilename:oncompletion:)-8h2ag","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"fileExporter"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"D"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"isPresented"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","text":"Binding"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"document"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"D"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"contentType"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:22UniformTypeIdentifiers6UTTypeV","text":"UTType"},{"kind